Dialogue: 10,0:01:32.43,0:01:34.56,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Orienteering!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:34.56,0:01:37.27,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,They said we can get started!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:38.89,0:01:41.33,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Why are you so peppy today?{or chirpy, lively, chipper, etc.}
Dialogue: 10,0:01:41.85,0:01:44.70,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I'm trying to leave all that moping behind me!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:44.70,0:01:49.25,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,All you're accomplishing is getting yourself lumped in with Kominato.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:49.25,0:01:52.63,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Hyper goin' now, yo yo yo!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:52.63,0:01:55.80,AoHaru alt,,0,0,0,,Super orienteering!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:54.33,0:01:56.50,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I'll get you into the groove in no time!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:56.50,0:01:57.80,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Just you wait!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:58.53,0:02:00.39,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I'd really rather you didn't.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:00.39,0:02:02.33,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:02.33,0:02:03.24,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:05.29,0:02:06.81,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,No doing this half-hearted.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:07.43,0:02:10.18,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,I'm going to make the whole team get along.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:10.73,0:02:11.73,AoHaru alt,,0,0,100,,{\pos(641.333,642.667)}This way!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:11.02,0:02:13.78,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,We have to come together.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:14.71,0:02:17.05,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,From there, we can draw the start line,
Dialogue: 10,0:02:17.61,0:02:19.91,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,and open up a new page!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:23.19,0:02:26.29,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Look, we found a checkpoint!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.99,0:02:32.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.8\fs60\bord0\shad0\fnKFhimaji\fax0\pos(890,574)\frz358.5\c&H474846&}Checkpoint
Dialogue: 10,0:02:26.29,0:02:28.36,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Hey, you made it.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:28.36,0:02:32.84,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,The challenge here is to guess what we've mixed into this juice.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:32.84,0:02:35.30,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,There are five ingredients.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:35.30,0:02:38.63,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,You get one point for each correct answer.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:38.63,0:02:41.31,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,The obvious ones are apple and banana.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:44.22,0:02:45.79,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,What else could be in it?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:48.00,0:02:50.40,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Something happened to Mabuchi.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:50.40,0:02:52.02,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,What's wrong, Kou?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:52.02,0:02:54.11,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,It tastes like celery.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:54.11,0:02:55.56,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Wait, seriously?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:58.02,0:02:59.61,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I can't tell...
Dialogue: 10,0:02:59.61,0:03:01.68,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,It's {\i1}definitely{\i0} in there.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:02.53,0:03:04.25,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Do you hate celery or something?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:04.25,0:03:06.32,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,That reaction has me believing.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:09.54,0:03:13.19,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,No fair, Murao-san! C'mon and drink your share.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:23.59,0:03:26.63,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,It's all safe to drink, right?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:26.63,0:03:30.35,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Of course! I made it myself.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:36.67,0:03:37.65,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Thyme.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:39.10,0:03:41.01,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,What, you want more time?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:41.01,0:03:43.66,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,No, I mean, there's thyme in it.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:43.66,0:03:44.92,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Thyme?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:45.66,0:03:47.87,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Oh, the spice!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:47.87,0:03:52.57,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Wow! You're the first team to get celery and thyme.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:52.57,0:03:54.95,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,You're the leaders so far.
