Dialogue: 10,0:05:03.66,0:05:05.28,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Map...
Dialogue: 10,0:05:07.74,0:05:10.40,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Isn't that the last checkpoint?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:10.40,0:05:12.70,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Yeah, finally here.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:13.73,0:05:17.14,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,I feel so useless...
Dialogue: 10,0:05:24.04,0:05:28.12,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Have you told Yoshioka-san about what you saw yesterday?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:28.79,0:05:30.59,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Should I have?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:32.45,0:05:35.26,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, I haven't said a word.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:35.82,0:05:40.20,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,But I don't think Futaba-chan would tell anyone even if she knew.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:41.44,0:05:44.55,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,What's up? Talking about something fun?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:49.38,0:05:51.56,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,It's nothing, Futaba-chan.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:52.41,0:05:53.62,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Okay then!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:54.71,0:05:58.37,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,Hearing that makes it hard to keep pressing her.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:59.32,0:06:03.06,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,Guess I still can't bring myself to say what I really want to.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:03.84,0:06:06.57,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,Wait, this is no time to hesitate.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:06.57,0:06:09.96,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,Changing that part of me is exactly what I'm working towards right now!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:09.96,0:06:10.85,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,Let's move on!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:12.17,0:06:15.81,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Nice, we got all the keywords!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:15.81,0:06:19.77,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Huh, so they want us to put them in order?
