Dialogue: 10,0:06:20.71,0:06:23.23,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,The biggest lake?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:25.09,0:06:26.69,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,That must be the goal!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:29.78,0:06:31.62,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Look! Right there!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:32.23,0:06:35.75,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,We have plenty of points, and we're doing great on time.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:35.75,0:06:38.25,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Could we really do it?
