Dialogue: 10,0:06:39.58,0:06:41.00,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:45.66,0:06:47.96,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,So, uh, where are we?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:47.96,0:06:52.18,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,We ran around randomly, so we have no idea where we are.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:52.18,0:06:54.67,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I know! We can use our smartphones! {dis girl...}
Dialogue: 10,0:06:54.67,0:06:56.64,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,We had to leave them with the teachers, remember?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:58.07,0:06:59.39,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Now what?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:59.81,0:07:06.11,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,No problem! We can go by the terrain around us, the shape of the mountains, and the location of the sun.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:06.11,0:07:08.99,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,This is what orienteering is all about!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:21.19,0:07:23.71,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,We're completely lost.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:29.10,0:07:30.68,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Now we're screwed.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:30.68,0:07:34.20,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,What? You tryin' to say it's my fault?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:34.20,0:07:36.01,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I said nothing of the sort.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:36.01,0:07:38.68,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,You all agreed to follow me!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:38.68,0:07:41.19,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I told you, that's not what I said.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:41.19,0:07:43.38,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,This is no time to be fighting.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:43.38,0:07:45.70,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,We need to get out of the forest, and fast.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:48.26,0:07:52.87,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,It's not all that large, so I'm sure we can make it out if we keep moving.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:52.87,0:07:54.03,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 10,0:07:54.53,0:07:57.66,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Is it really a good idea to wander around like that?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:57.66,0:08:03.00,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Shouldn't we just wait here for the teachers to come find us?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:06.36,0:08:07.89,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I hear a river.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:13.78,0:08:18.95,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Considering the lake we're looking for should be that direction, there's probably a way out, too. {I only just considered they could very well be on the opposite side}
Dialogue: 10,0:08:19.74,0:08:22.03,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Let's go as far as we can while it's still light out.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:22.57,0:08:28.19,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,If we can't escape by sunset, then we'll stop and wait, like Makita suggested.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:28.64,0:08:30.15,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,How's that sound?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:31.84,0:08:34.43,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Don't you worry. We're all in this together.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:39.08,0:08:41.56,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Check it out, it's the river!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:42.75,0:08:45.21,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,The current's pretty slow, so we can make it across.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:45.73,0:08:46.51,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:01.09,0:09:03.05,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Easy as pie!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:07.75,0:09:10.21,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Don't relax until you're safely across.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:10.21,0:09:12.52,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,That really gave me a start.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:13.20,0:09:14.99,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Yuuri, be careful!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:14.99,0:09:19.20,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I'm scared! I can't do it!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:19.68,0:09:22.04,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&H40&\shad0}Take your time!{I don't know what's going on with these lines but I don't think it works. Maybe if they were all centered}
Dialogue: 9,0:09:19.68,0:09:22.04,AoHaru alt,,0,0,0,,{\pos(447.667,684.904)\alpha&H10&\shad0}Just take it step by step.
Dialogue: 9,0:09:19.68,0:09:22.04,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H1E4409&\alpha&H10&\shad0\pos(803.429,685)}Sprint as fast as you can!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:22.04,0:09:24.08,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Don't all talk at once!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:25.51,0:09:27.29,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,What is she doing?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:28.49,0:09:29.59,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Makita!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:30.95,0:09:32.45,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Here, grab on.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:32.45,0:09:34.42,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,But I'm scared...
Dialogue: 10,0:09:34.73,0:09:36.44,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Just give me your hand already.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:37.54,0:09:38.18,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:39.24,0:09:41.16,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I'll fall I'll fall!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:43.52,0:09:44.52,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,See? You did it.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:48.68,0:09:50.99,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,You can make it across.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:53.93,0:09:55.03,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Can't you?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:59.95,0:10:03.91,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Makita, keep at it!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:04.61,0:10:07.33,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,Kou, you really amaze me.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:07.33,0:10:10.24,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,You completely calmed Yuuri down.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:12.62,0:10:14.26,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,You did really well.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:14.26,0:10:16.94,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Mabuchi-kun.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:16.94,0:10:17.92,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:19.75,0:10:22.08,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Sorry I made you all worry.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:22.08,0:10:24.62,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I'm just glad you're safe.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:24.62,0:10:26.77,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Alright, let's get moving.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:27.27,0:10:28.54,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:32.60,0:10:34.76,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,We should probably speed it up.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:36.63,0:10:40.76,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,Uh oh... I think I hurt my foot when I fell.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:40.76,0:10:43.06,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,It hurts like hell to walk!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:57.42,0:10:59.93,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Did you hurt your foot?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:01.26,0:11:02.93,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,No way, not at all!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:02.93,0:11:04.22,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,You hurt your foot.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:06.97,0:11:08.31,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Was it at the river?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:08.98,0:11:10.10,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Futaba-chan...
Dialogue: 10,0:11:10.56,0:11:14.61,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I'll find the way out and bring the teachers back.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:16.03,0:11:19.20,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,It'll be dark soon, so there's no time to waste.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:19.61,0:11:21.82,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,It'd be even worse to split up here.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:22.57,0:11:25.91,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,The worst-case scenario is if it gets dark before you find a way out.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:29.08,0:11:31.96,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about me! Let's just get out of here.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:33.71,0:11:35.46,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Kominato, hold this for me.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:38.67,0:11:39.51,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Get on.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:42.13,0:11:43.64,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I'll carry you back.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:44.60,0:11:46.06,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,No, it's embarrassing!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:46.51,0:11:49.64,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,You don't have the luxury to be embarrassed.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:50.23,0:11:53.06,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Get on or you'll just be slowing the rest of us down.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:57.86,0:12:00.61,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Futaba-chan, I'll hold your bag.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:00.61,0:12:02.45,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Oh, thanks.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:03.70,0:12:06.83,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Then, I'll take you up on your offer...
Dialogue: 10,0:12:08.99,0:12:10.75,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I-I'm kind of heavy.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:10.75,0:12:12.16,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Shut up and get on.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:14.12,0:12:15.46,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,You were right.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:15.46,0:12:17.80,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,A-Aren't I? Let me down and I'll walk!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:20.13,0:12:25.18,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I don't mind. The extra weight makes you feel more real in my hands. {was going to use existence, but >big words}{but "Stop delaying" is fine apparently | also I think prescriptivists would say it's "realer" but fuck them}
Dialogue: 10,0:12:26.60,0:12:28.14,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Weird response.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:29.01,0:12:35.48,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,But he doesn't seem to disapprove of me being here, so I have that.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:36.98,0:12:38.40,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,Weirdo...
Dialogue: 10,0:12:42.74,0:12:44.11,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,He's warm.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:45.07,0:12:46.99,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,I can smell Kou. {'s scent}{nein}
Dialogue: 10,0:13:36.58,0:13:37.96,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Yuuri.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:37.96,0:13:39.59,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Are you still awake?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:40.84,0:13:42.71,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'm up.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:42.71,0:13:46.55,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,A lot went wrong today, but it sure was fun.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:46.55,0:13:49.64,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Yeah! Too bad we ended up finishing last.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:51.85,0:13:52.97,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,So, hey...
Dialogue: 10,0:13:54.73,0:13:57.23,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Back in the middle of orienteering...
Dialogue: 10,0:13:58.85,0:14:00.36,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,What were you and Murao-san...
Dialogue: 10,0:14:04.53,0:14:05.53,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Never mind.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:07.91,0:14:10.12,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Futaba-chan, listen.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:11.87,0:14:16.79,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I've always tended to keep to myself, but it's not like I didn't get lonely.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:18.71,0:14:21.25,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,When you talked to me that day,
Dialogue: 10,0:14:21.71,0:14:24.59,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,can you imagine just how happy I was?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:25.05,0:14:26.09,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,That's why...
Dialogue: 10,0:14:29.68,0:14:34.77,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I'll never leave you alone. I promise.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:39.44,0:14:43.65,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Me too! I understand just how much it hurts to be alone.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:47.11,0:14:51.57,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I'll always be your friend, no matter what. {through think and thin}{hopefully not too many thinks}
Dialogue: 10,0:14:53.12,0:14:53.91,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Thanks!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:19.23,0:15:20.27,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Kou?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:24.90,0:15:25.98,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Kou!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:26.32,0:15:27.82,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Yoshioka.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:27.82,0:15:30.03,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,What are you doing out this early?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:30.65,0:15:34.83,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I couldn't get back to sleep, so I figured I'd watch the sunrise.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:36.08,0:15:38.37,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,How's your ankle?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:38.37,0:15:41.79,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I feel fine now. The painkillers are helping.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:42.12,0:15:43.21,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,That's good.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:44.92,0:15:47.55,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,There's just a tiny tinge of light on the horizon.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:47.55,0:15:50.51,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I can't tell whether it's night or day.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:53.09,0:15:55.80,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,For some reason, it reminds me of you.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:55.80,0:15:57.06,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,What part?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:57.06,0:16:00.64,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I can't tell whether you're kind or mean.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:01.31,0:16:03.48,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,That makes two of us.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:04.69,0:16:07.86,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I can't tell if you're incompetent or courageous.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:14.66,0:16:17.28,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,Caught between night and day,
Dialogue: 10,0:16:18.08,0:16:19.29,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,just like us.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:26.96,0:16:29.09,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,It's pretty chilly, so put that on.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:30.09,0:16:32.22,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Won't you get cold then?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:33.13,0:16:34.68,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I'm alright.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:35.26,0:16:36.60,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:36.60,0:16:39.39,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,We still have some time before the sun rises.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:40.64,0:16:41.85,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I know!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:51.15,0:16:53.03,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Man, you totally beat us here!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:57.16,0:16:58.33,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Hey...
Dialogue: 10,0:16:59.33,0:17:02.58,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Did you seriously not grab a jacket when you were in your room?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:03.12,0:17:06.38,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Sorry! Here, I'll give it back.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:06.38,0:17:07.54,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Forget it.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:08.88,0:17:10.42,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,You can keep it on.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:32.07,0:17:36.53,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Alright, here it comes! Almost here!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:37.95,0:17:40.70,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,It's here!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:42.49,0:17:44.20,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Daybreak.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:45.00,0:17:47.33,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,The beginning of a new day.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:51.00,0:17:52.92,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,The scent of damp ground.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:53.55,0:17:55.13,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,The scent of morning dew. {apparently tsuyukusa is something called a dayflower, but there's no way she said that}{why not?}
Dialogue: 10,0:17:55.63,0:17:57.59,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,The scent of a May morning.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:59.09,0:18:05.14,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,I don't think I'll ever forget watching this sunrise with everyone.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:06.27,0:18:08.35,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,One day, when we look back on this...
Dialogue: 10,0:18:09.23,0:18:12.73,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I want everyone who shared this experience
Dialogue: 10,0:18:12.73,0:18:16.03,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,to remember these fun and warm times.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:17.03,0:18:21.28,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I really like that line. It completely \Nembodies what adolescence is all about.{a sentence is not a phrase}
Dialogue: 10,0:18:21.99,0:18:23.70,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,You really feel no shame.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:25.00,0:18:27.46,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,If you get embarrassed, you lose, man.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:29.37,0:18:35.01,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Don't lose your passion until you're old and wrinkled!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:35.38,0:18:38.34,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,And I doubt you ever will.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:52.11,0:18:55.40,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Anyone forget anything? If not, we're leaving.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:03.49,0:19:05.24,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,They're crushing me!
