Dialogue: 10,0:19:11.46,0:19:14.50,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Yeah. Thanks a lot.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:15.92,0:19:18.72,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,My mom's coming to pick me up.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:18.72,0:19:19.80,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:24.30,0:19:27.10,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,It doesn't even hurt that much.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:27.77,0:19:30.73,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Still, you shouldn't push it.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:30.73,0:19:32.98,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you're right.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:34.82,0:19:36.40,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Kou, aren't you going home?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:36.40,0:19:37.78,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Hey, a cat.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:41.61,0:19:44.70,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me... you're going to keep me company?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:46.08,0:19:48.70,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about it, you can go—
Dialogue: 10,0:19:48.70,0:19:49.50,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Look!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:50.29,0:19:53.92,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Check it out. He's only got one sock on.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:03.26,0:20:05.76,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,He's still just a kitty. {we could use she here}
Dialogue: 10,0:20:05.76,0:20:07.31,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Wonder if he's stray.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:07.31,0:20:08.52,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Seems to like people, though.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:10.43,0:20:13.15,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,I'm learning more about Kou.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.15,0:20:14.48,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,He hates celery.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:15.40,0:20:16.69,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,He likes cats.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:17.90,0:20:20.19,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,He may have a rough way of speaking,
Dialogue: 10,0:20:20.90,0:20:22.03,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,but in reality...
Dialogue: 10,0:20:22.82,0:20:23.99,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,...he's gentle.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:30.41,0:20:31.71,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,My ride's here.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:35.04,0:20:37.09,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Guess I'll head back too.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:37.59,0:20:38.55,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Later.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:41.59,0:20:42.51,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Kou!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:43.05,0:20:45.43,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Thanks for waiting with me.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:45.89,0:20:49.39,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Huh? I was just playing with that cat.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:50.77,0:20:52.56,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,That's what I thought you'd say!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:53.85,0:20:58.82,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,He's no longer the Kou I remember. \NBoth his voice and height have changed.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:00.90,0:21:02.78,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,But now I can say I know...
Dialogue: 10,0:21:04.11,0:21:05.53,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,...the sixteen-year-old Kou.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:06.62,0:21:09.74,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,The one who made my heart skip a beat...
Dialogue: 10,0:21:11.37,0:21:13.12,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,...was the sixteen-year-old Kou.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:14.33,0:21:17.71,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,Have I fallen in love with...
Dialogue: 10,0:21:27.14,0:21:28.64,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,A text from Yuuri.
